│                                  ││                                          │
│                                  ││Plasma rewrites its settings when it      │
│                                  ││quits, so files restored while it runs can│
│                                  ││be overwritten again. Restarting the shell│
│                                  ││around the apply avoids that; a full log  │
│                                  ││out and in is the most reliable. KWin     │
│                                  ││(window manager) settings need a log out  │
│                                  ││or a KWin reconfigure.                    │
